		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4715f29 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4715f29" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d4da7b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5d4da7b2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sofa Cleaning Services in Rawalpindi</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4151eacb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4151eacb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Life in Rawalpindi comes with constant dust, heavy foot traffic, and the occasional chai spill, but your sofa doesn’t have to suffer. At The Capital Tankers, we’re a 5-star rated service trusted by homeowners across Saddar, Bahria Town, PWD, Chaklala, and nearby areas for professional in-home sofa cleaning. We use eco-friendly solutions, modern steam machines, and fast-drying methods that are safe for kids and pets. Get your free quote today.</p>								</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-91da1be e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="91da1be" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
