		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f711692 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="f711692" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-249a393 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="249a393" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Exclusive Sofa cleaning in Rawalpindi</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7611620 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7611620" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>We provide a full range of sofa cleaning services designed specifically for homes and offices in Rawalpindi. Whether it’s leather sofas, fabric upholstery, L-shaped seating, or daily-use office sofas, our approach is adjusted to local living conditions and usage patterns. Using professional sofa cleaning machines, targeted tools, and safe cleaning agents, we remove built-up dust, stains, and odors without over-wetting, keeping your furniture fresh, clean, and comfortable for everyday use.</p>								</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e79bedf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e79bedf" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-69ca2b9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="69ca2b9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dd75ce7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="dd75ce7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Deep/Dry Sofa Cleaning Rawalpindi</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-343776f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="343776f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Deep and dry sofa cleaning is ideal for fabric sofas, leather couches, and L-shaped seating that collect dust, chai spills, and daily wear in Rawalpindi homes. We use eco-friendly shampoo, modern sofa cleaning machines, and a fast-dry method to lift stains, odors, and allergens without harming the fabric.</p><p>Families in Bahria Town, DHA Phase 1–5, Saddar, PWD, and Chaklala rely on our same-day service to enjoy fresh, hygienic sofas that are ready to use within hours.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7bed980 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7bed980" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23f313d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="23f313d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20768'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1262" alt="Sofa Cleaning Services Islamabad" data-lazy-srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-1536x1152.webp 1536w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-2048x1536.webp 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1262" alt="Sofa Cleaning Services Islamabad" srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-1536x1152.webp 1536w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Cleaning-Services-Islamabad-2048x1536.webp 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript>															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f818c3e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f818c3e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1de476d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1de476d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-64d53d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="64d53d0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Leather Sofa Cleaning Rawalpindi</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9970c1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9970c1c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Leather sofas need special care to stay soft, shiny, and crack-free, especially in Rawalpindi&#8217;s dusty climate. Our leather sofa cleaning service gently removes dirt, body oils, and stains using safe leather cleaners and conditioning treatments.</p><p>This process restores the natural finish, prevents drying or damage, and keeps your sofa looking luxurious for years. From homes in Bahria Town to offices in PWD Housing, and Defence Housing Authority we offer same-day service that leaves your leather furniture spotless and refreshed.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-19891bc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="19891bc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fcdf0af elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="fcdf0af" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20768'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1267" alt="" data-lazy-srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1267" alt="" srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Leather-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript>															</div>
