		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b43ca1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8b43ca1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8dd55fe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8dd55fe" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4a0eb49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="4a0eb49" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Fabric Sofa Cleaning Rawalpindi</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a87012d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a87012d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Dust, spills, and everyday use can make fabric sofas look tired and unhygienic, a common problem in Islamabad&#8217;s climate. Our fabric sofa cleaning service is designed to revive your furniture with safe shampoo, advanced cleaning machines, and fast-dry technology.</p><p>We remove deep-seated dirt, tea stains, and allergens without harming the fabric&#8217;s texture or color. From apartments in G-11 to villas in DHA and Bahria Town, we deliver spotless, fresh results the same day. Give your living room the care it deserves. Get a free quote today!</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2848f99 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2848f99" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5696d7a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="5696d7a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20768'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1265" alt="Fabric Sofa Cleaning Islamabad" data-lazy-srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1265" alt="Fabric Sofa Cleaning Islamabad" srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fabric-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript>															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-508145a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="508145a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d9c0d01 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="d9c0d01" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ee9eb2c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ee9eb2c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sofa Shampoo cleaning</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c5d649e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c5d649e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Our sofa shampoo cleaning service is perfect for removing deep stains, trapped dust, and foul odors that regular vacuuming can&#8217;t fix. Using professional-grade sofa shampoo and advanced foam extraction machines.</p><p>We gently clean every inch of your sofa, leaving it fresh and hygienic without soaking the fabric. Whether you&#8217;re in Dhoke Kala Khan, DHA, or Bahria Town, we deliver same-day results that make your sofas look and feel like new. Restore the comfort of your living room. Book your shampoo cleaning today.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-be32db2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="be32db2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9a2835c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="9a2835c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20768'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1270" alt="Sofa Shampoo Cleaning Islamabad" data-lazy-srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1270" alt="Sofa Shampoo Cleaning Islamabad" srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sofa-Shampoo-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript>															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-890de21 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="890de21" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ba25aae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="ba25aae" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b2fd3d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b2fd3d0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sofa steam cleaning</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-53485cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="53485cf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Sofa steam cleaning service is the safest way to refresh and sanitize your furniture. Using high-temperature steam, we remove dirt, bacteria, and allergens from fabric, velvet, and upholstery sofas, no harsh chemicals needed.</p><p>This method is ideal if you&#8217;ve been wondering how to clean a fabric sofa without a steam cleaner at home, or if you&#8217;ve tried hacks like steam cleaning with an iron but want professional results. From DHA to Dhoke Kashmiriyan, we offer expert sofa and carpet steam cleaning that leaves your furniture spotless and hygienic.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aac1715 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="aac1715" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-af9fbaa elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="af9fbaa" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20768'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1269" alt="Sofa steam cleaning islamabad" data-lazy-srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1269" alt="Sofa steam cleaning islamabad" srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Steam-Sofa-Cleaning-Islamabad.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript>															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f840086 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f840086" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5040e85 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5040e85" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-01f3a15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="01f3a15" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Routine and spot cleaning</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-593b761 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="593b761" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Spilled chai on the cushions? Kids left crumbs everywhere? Our routine and spot cleaning service is the easiest way to keep your sofas fresh without waiting for a full deep clean.</p><p>We vacuum every corner, neutralize odors with safe baking soda treatment, and gently treat stains so they don&#8217;t set in. Perfect for busy homes in Westridge, Bahria Town, or DHA, this service saves your sofa from long-term damage and keeps it guest-ready every day. Stay worry-free. Schedule your quick sofa refresh today.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e7895b7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e7895b7" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-219fad3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="219fad3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20768'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1268" alt="Sofa Routine and Spot Cleaning" data-lazy-srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning.webp 1100w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-1024x768.webp" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-1024x768.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1268" alt="Sofa Routine and Spot Cleaning" srcset="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-1024x768.webp 1024w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-300x225.webp 300w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning-768x576.webp 768w, https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Routine-Sofa-Cleaning.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript>															</div>
