					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-655cbaee e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="655cbaee" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-60fc69a9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="60fc69a9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-421ba392 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="421ba392" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">What is Sofa Cleaning &amp; Why is it needed in Rawalpindi?</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-12e6500c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="12e6500c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Sofa cleaning is a professional process that goes beyond simple vacuuming. It removes deep-seated dirt, stubborn stains, and hidden allergens from your furniture using safe and effective methods. Unlike basic home remedies, professional sofa cleaning restores long-lasting hygiene and freshness. Specialized equipment, eco-friendly sofa cleaning liquids, and techniques like shampooing or steam cleaning help revive the fabric and make your sofa healthier to use.</p><p>In Rawalpindi, constant dust from busy roads, markets, and nearby construction quickly settles into sofa fabric. Daily use, chai spills, kids’ mess, and pet hair make sofas a hidden source of bacteria and allergies. Regular sofa cleaning keeps your home fresh and hygienic, extends sofa life, reduces allergens, and improves indoor air quality for your family. </p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2d81b205 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="2d81b205" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="tel:%20+923285133173">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Call Us Now</span>
					</span>
					</a>
								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-583c155 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="583c155" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9d1db6a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9d1db6a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-02b1558 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="02b1558" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Testimonials</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f2f350d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f2f350d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Our customers across Rawalpindi trust The Capital Tankers because we deliver more than just cleaning. We deliver peace of mind!</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-281e6db elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="281e6db" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
