Recommended.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1770768000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8AZs47sn7NECUTENZan7EunSBbZEEz6cY8yPIquKIT6h8xWmTig=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100" alt="Azhar Ali Ihsan profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Azhar Ali Ihsan </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Recently, we faced an unexpected water shortage due to water line cleaning by CDA. It was a late-night emergency, and we contacted several water supplier companies. Unfortunately, most of them were unable to process our request at that time and asked us to wait until the next morning. A few suppliers who had water available were charging unreasonably high rates.

In this difficult situation, The Capital Tanker Company responded promptly and arranged a water tanker for us at a very reasonable cost. Their quick response, professionalism, and fair pricing during an emergency truly impressed us.

We highly appreciate their service and would strongly recommend The Capital Tanker Company to anyone in need of reliable and timely water supply services.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1770768000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKEfE4tycmvt637_fp7rCLABgL8ONTnKfTD2k8GwV0TlwAAMQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Anum Iqbal profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Anum Iqbal </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Experienced Efficient service in case of emergency.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1770681600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXk_iLDB5SM1wzynLG84oKs-yYyi0tCHJ2r-6eCLMo6WsDhbZI=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Jameel Khan profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Jameel Khan </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Beat tanker service, keep their promises<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  </div> <div class="ti-controls-line"> <div class="dot"></div> </div> </div>    </div> </div> </template></pre><div data-src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/loader.js?wp-widget" data-template-id="trustindex-google-widget-html" data-css-url="https://thecapitaltankers.com/wp-content/uploads/trustindex-google-widget.css?1772741333"></div></div>
