				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-21d669f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="21d669f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-213502c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="213502c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-59948c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="59948c1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How Our Sofa Cleaning Process Works?</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-be85c7a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="be85c7a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Our sofa cleaning process is designed for maximum hygiene, safety, and convenience. We start with a detailed inspection, then use eco-friendly products and modern machines to remove dust, stains, and odors. Each step ensures your sofa looks fresh, feels soft, and dries quickly for same-day use.</p><p>Here’s how it works:</p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><strong>Inspection &amp; Fabric Check:</strong> We assess your sofa’s material and condition to choose the safest cleaning method.</li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><strong>Dust &amp; Vacuum:</strong> Powerful suction removes surface dust, crumbs, and pet hair.</li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Deep Cleaning/Shampoo/Steam:</strong> Based on fabric type, we perform deep shampooing or steam cleaning to lift stains and bacteria.</span></li><li aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Stain &amp; Odor Treatment:</strong> Targeted solutions remove spills, odors, and allergens effectively.</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Quick Dry &amp; Final Touch:</strong> Sofas are dried using air movers, leaving them fresh, clean, and ready to use within hours.</span></li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-27d64c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="27d64c8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
