		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c6c2d58 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c6c2d58" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f7322a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="f7322a3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">how much is sofa cleaning service cost in Rawalpindi?</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7c470d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7c470d2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>In Rawalpindi, sofa cleaning service costs are usually calculated per seat and vary based on fabric type, sofa size, and cleaning depth. For standard fabric sofas, prices commonly fall between PKR <strong>250 to 400</strong> per seat. A typical 3-seater may cost PKR <strong>750</strong> to <strong>1,200</strong>, while 5-seater sets are often bundled between PKR <strong>1,250</strong> to <strong>2,000</strong>. Larger 7-seater sofas generally range around PKR <strong>2,000</strong> to <strong>2,100</strong>.</p><p>Premium sofas, such as L-shaped sets, leather, or velvet, require extra care and specialized products, which can increase the cost to PKR <strong>2,000</strong> to <strong>4,000</strong> or more, depending on condition and service quality. These rates reflect the local Rawalpindi market and help customers choose services based on transparency, fabric safety, and overall value rather than just the lowest price.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f4f6a03 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f4f6a03" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
